# Rerac-vr's pointing rule: on a page with things to point at the sticks leave the cursor alone, wherever the hand is;
# with the right hand gone the sticks are the way left. The cursor must stay in "pointed-away" and move in "hand-gone".
600 y 1
606 y 0
3000 y 1
3006 y 0
3010 hand_pitch -70
3100 shot start
3120 left_y -1
3132 left_y 0
3200 shot pointed-away
3220 right_gone 1
3260 left_y -1
3272 left_y 0
3340 shot hand-gone
3400 quit 0
